      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793682319275,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Spanning Tree\n=============\n\n\nSpanning tree is a special type of tree of a graph :\n\n1. It has no cycle \n\n2. Every vertex is reachable directly or indirectly from\nevery other vertex .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Spanning Tree\n=============\n\n\nSpanning tree is a special type of tree of a graph :\n\n1. It has no cycle \n\n2. Every vertex is reachable directly or indirectly from every other vertex .",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ouocuZhgCMvXwh8KgIPXV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 525.3700414874831,
      "y": 434.67998270476306,
      "width": 560.3092488472187,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1207357998,
      "version": 423,
      "versionNonce": 335603822,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1793682869396,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MCST- ( Minimum Cost Spanning Tree )\n==================================\n\nMCST is a tree of a connected , undirected , weighted\ngraph that connects all vertices without forming any\ncycle and has the minimum possible sum of edeg weights .",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MCST- ( Minimum Cost Spanning Tree )\n==================================\n\nMCST is a tree of a connected , undirected , weighted graph that connects all vertices without forming any cycle and has the minimum possible sum of edeg weights .",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
